{"id":"133865925995a5f4","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-independent-sequence.md","title":"0′ 可计算的可数独立列","display":"thm-independent-sequence — 0′ 可计算的可数独立列","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-independent-sequence","aliases":["20-thm-independent-sequence"],"display":"thm-independent-sequence — 0′ 可计算的可数独立列","chapter":"6","section":"6.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 6.1.4","source_printed_pages":[133],"source_pdf_pages":[167],"depends_on":["[[20-df-computable-independence]]","[[20-thm-kleene-post]]","[[20-df-strings]]","[[20-df-jump]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-independent-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-independent-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-independent-sequence — 0′ 可计算的可数独立列"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 6.1.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>133</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>167</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"96978d2a748174af\" href=\"?note=96978d2a748174af\" title=\"20-df-computable-independence\">20-df-computable-independence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"02c10d5d18aba717\" href=\"?note=02c10d5d18aba717\" title=\"20-thm-kleene-post\">20-thm-kleene-post</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>集合序列的整体信息按上游可数 join 编码。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"96978d2a748174af\" href=\"?note=96978d2a748174af\" title=\"20-df-computable-independence\">20-df-computable-independence</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"02c10d5d18aba717\" href=\"?note=02c10d5d18aba717\" title=\"20-thm-kleene-post\">20-thm-kleene-post</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}independent\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\exists\\vec A=(A_i)_{i\\in\\omega}\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{CompIndependent}(\\vec A)\\land\\bigoplus_iA_i\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}independent\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\exists\\vec A=(A_i)_{i\\in\\omega}\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{CompIndependent}(\\vec A)\\land\\bigoplus_iA_i\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>维护有限支持的矩阵，每列为有限二进制前缀；尚未出现的列为空。依次处理要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(i,e)\">\\((i,e)\\)</span>：取第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 列首个未定位置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>，用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 问是否存在其余列的有限扩张，使删列 oracle 上的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e(n)\">\\(\\Phi_e(n)\\)</span> 停止。第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 列在该 oracle 中始终为空，查询该列的回答固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>，不参与待定信息。停止见证只查询有限多个其余列，因而存在性是普通 c.e. 问题。有见证则同时扩张这些列，并令第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 列的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 位异于输出；无则任意补位，并由否定判定保证该输入永久发散。</p>\n<p>阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 末将所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\le s\">\\(i\\le s\\)</span> 的列补至长度至少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+1\">\\(s+1\\)</span>。每阶段仍只规定有限信息，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 统一计算该矩阵；给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(i,x)\">\\((i,x)\\)</span>，模拟至该位已规定，得到整体 join 的归约。每个要求永久成立，故得到所述强独立性。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 6.1.4；印刷页 133；PDF 第 167 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-computable-independence","status":"resolved","id":"96978d2a748174af","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable-independence]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-kleene-post","status":"resolved","id":"02c10d5d18aba717","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-kleene-post]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable-independence","status":"resolved","id":"96978d2a748174af","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-independence]]；see [[20-thm-kleene-post]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-jump]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-kleene-post","status":"resolved","id":"02c10d5d18aba717","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-independence]]；see [[20-thm-kleene-post]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-jump]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-independence]]；see [[20-thm-kleene-post]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-jump]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-independence]]；see [[20-thm-kleene-post]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-jump]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}independent\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\exists\\vec A=(A_i)_{i\\in\\omega}\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{CompIndependent}(\\vec A)\\land\\bigoplus_iA_i\\le_T\\varnothing'].","display":true},{"tex":"(i,e)","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing'","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_e(n)","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"i\\le s","display":false},{"tex":"s+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing'","display":false},{"tex":"(i,x)","display":false}],"bytes":2032,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-286","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-independent-sequence]] — 章 6；直接